<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Gablefen Realty</a></li><li>Open houses</li></ol><p class="kick">The open-house board</p><h1>This weekend, today, and happening now</h1><p class="lede">Each open house stores a weekday and a start and end time, not a single calendar date, so this board stays current week after week. The status of each one is worked out on the server from the date and time.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight" style="padding-bottom:70px"><div class="w"><div class="dg"><div><ul class="oh" style="color:inherit">{% for o in Target.Items %}{%- assign oy=o.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture _nosm -%}{{ oy.start_min }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign osm = _nosm | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture _noem -%}{{ oy.end_min }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign oem = _noem | plus: 0 -%}{%- capture od -%}{{ oy.dow }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign ohs = "later" -%}{% if od == today_dow %}{% if nowm >= osm and nowm < oem %}{%- assign ohs = "now" -%}{% elsif nowm < osm %}{%- assign ohs = "today" -%}{% else %}{%- assign ohs = "ended" -%}{% endif %}{% elsif od == "sat" or od == "sun" %}{%- assign ohs = "weekend" -%}{% endif %}{%- capture ohmsg -%}{% case ohs %}{% when "now" %}Happening now{% when "today" %}Today · opens {% assign _h3 = osm | divided_by: 60 | floor -%}{%- assign _m3 = osm | modulo: 60 -%}{%- assign _a3 = "am" -%}{% if _h3 >= 24 %}{%- assign _h3 = _h3 | minus: 24 -%}{% endif %}{% if _h3 >= 12 %}{%- assign _a3 = "pm" -%}{% endif %}{% if _h3 > 12 %}{%- assign _h3 = _h3 | minus: 12 -%}{% endif %}{% if _h3 == 0 %}{%- assign _h3 = 12 -%}{% endif %}{{ _h3 }}:{% if _m3 < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ _m3 }} {{ _a3 }}{% when "ended" %}Ended today{% when "weekend" %}This weekend{% else %}{% capture lv20 -%}{{ oy.dow }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv20 %}{% when "wed" %}Wednesday{% when "fri" %}Friday{% when "sat" %}Saturday{% when "sun" %}Sunday{% else %}{{ lv20 }}{% endcase %}{% endcase %}{%- endcapture -%}<li style="padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)"><i class="dot {{ ohs }}"></i><span><a href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ o.RoutePath }}" style="color:var(--frame)"><b>{{ oy.listing_name }}</b></a><small>{{ oy.date_label }} · {% capture lv21 -%}{{ oy.dow }}{%- endcapture %}{% case lv21 %}{% when "wed" %}Wednesday{% when "fri" %}Friday{% when "sat" %}Saturday{% when "sun" %}Sunday{% else %}{{ lv21 }}{% endcase %}</small></span><em>{{ ohmsg }}</em></li>{% endfor %}</ul></div><aside class="boardcard side"><div class="hd"><b>At a glance</b><span>{{ tdate }} · {{ tshort }}</span></div><p style="margin:0;font-size:.92rem;color:#d7ccb8">A green light is happening now, brass is later today, brick is this weekend. Wednesday's broker tour at 8 Lintel Street is for agents; buyers should call the office.</p></aside></div></div></section>
